WEBVTT

00:00:59.546 --> 00:01:02.779
Hey, excuse me, I can see you.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:06.244
(Recorded voice)
Hey, excuse me. I can see you.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.466
Kids can be the experts.

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:11.156
When we come together,
we can find the answers.

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:13.373
All you have to do is listen.

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:16.402
Boy 1: Fight for our future.

00:01:16.871 --> 00:01:21.863
(Italian) Help me to live
1,000 years more.

00:01:22.688 --> 00:01:24.657
(German) I am hungry!

00:01:24.681 --> 00:01:27.330
Boy 2: It's our future,
and it's getting hotter.

00:01:27.974 --> 00:01:30.751
(Recorded voice) It's our
future, and it's getting hotter.